# Binaries
# Anchored to the repo root: `go test` drops cascade-<random> binaries here, and
# an unanchored pattern would also swallow any file named cascade-* anywhere in
# the tree, including test scenarios, which then never reach CI.
/cascade
/cascade-*
dist/

# Go
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
go.work
go.work.sum

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Coverage
coverage.out
coverage.html

# Worktrees
.worktrees/
